{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121111523089-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121111810\"/><p>赤柱正灘泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（21日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該4處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該4處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:43:51.096431+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T03:15:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T06:24:34.044615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:37:22.744252+00:00","content_hash":"566f164f5fd66003fd21667d084a190232d238e5f47058ce6a58bf474fe50501","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}